note as DEP_diagram_08_clinical
  External references include patient/practitioner profiles, terminology,
  practice locations, files, consent, authorization, provenance and audit.
end note

note as CANONICAL_diagram_08_clinical
  PostgreSQL is the canonical clinical store. Offline/document transit
  may be used only as an encrypted synchronization buffer and never as an
  independent mutable source of truth.
end note

note as REC_DIAGNOSTICS_CLIN_diagram_08_clinical
  Diagnostic reports link to structured results and governed files in the
  diagnostics schema. Large imaging objects remain in PACS/VNA or object storage.
end note

