note as PHYSICAL_INDEX_POLICY
  PHYSICAL INDEX POLICY
  - Primary and unique indexes enforce identity and business keys.
  - Every foreign key used for joins/deletes has a supporting BTREE index.
  - Tenant/patient/status/time composites support RLS and operational queues.
  - GIN/GiST/BRIN are used only for justified search, range, geospatial or append-only access.
  - Partial indexes reference stable seeded concept IDs/functions in migrations, never labels.
  - Final inclusion is verified with representative EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS), write cost,
    cardinality and production-like load tests; unused/redundant indexes are rejected.
end note

@enduml
